Third-party code and dependencies

Firmware: Arduino-ESP32 core (LGPL-2.1), esp32-camera driver (Apache-2.0),
ESP-IDF (Apache-2.0), built with the pioarduino PlatformIO platform (Apache-2.0).

Android app: AndroidX and Jetpack Compose (Apache-2.0), Kotlin standard library and
kotlinx.coroutines (Apache-2.0).
